<title>USA: Molten Metal to buy back 2.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Molten Metal to buy back 2.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molten Metal Technology Inc said its board of directors had approved a stock repurchasing program of up to 2.0 million shares of the company's common stock or about 8.5 percent of its common stock outstanding.  </p>
<p>The company said its goal was to complete the program within one year. It said it intended to fund the repurchase from its working capital.There are about 23.5 million shares of common stock outstanding, it added.</p>
<p>Molten Metal Technology Inc is an environmental technology company based in Waltham, Mass.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
